WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.518
<v narrator>Before the grid, before the Warden, there was only rain.

2
00:00:04.518 --> 00:00:06.132
<v narrator>Rain, and a promise.

3
00:00:06.132 --> 00:00:08.633
<v narrator>He told her he would come back.

4
00:00:08.633 --> 00:00:09.520
<v narrator>He did not.
